For a solid embryo in contact with a perfectly flat mould wall as shown in the schematic, the wetting angle 𝜃 is_______ degrees. (Round off to one decimal place).





Given:

Surface tension between liquid and mould wall = 0.35 𝐽. 𝑚^{-2}

Surface tension between solid and mould wall = 0.02 𝐽. 𝑚^{-2}

Surface tension between liquid and solid = 0.40 𝐽. 𝑚^{-2}

